window.products.push({"id":456019,"name":"Creative Converting 8 Count Plastic Square Appetizer Plates, Translucent Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IF-NxEe4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Semi-disposable, on-trend mini and full size tabletop plastic party serving pieces, cutlery, picks and stirrers for all your entertaining needs. A distinctive clear and translucent contemporary plastics line that compliments solid and patterned paper tableware, all brought to you from Creative Converting, an experienced leader in the paper and party goods industry. Trend Ware plastics are a fresh new fun way to accessorize your dinner and party tables. Stylish colors for any everyday, holiday or summer gathering or event. Use for individual servings or for entertaining crowds, the Trend Ware line has everything you need. BPA free. Not intended for microwave use, hand wash to reuse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IF-NxEe4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B07L3L59GS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L3L59GS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L3L59GS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":456020,"name":"ARIGHTEX Yellow Pineapple Bed Set 3 Piece Summer Tropical Fruits Duvet Cover Teal Green Leaves Hawaiian Bedding for Teen Girls Boys (Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A138QpY9RjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To help your comforter stay cleaner and last longer, invest in a decorative bedding duvet cover. Duvets covers are machine washable and are made with easy-to-close hidden zippers, making it easy to take on and off. PRODUCT SPECIFICATION: - Fabric: 100% lightweight microfiber,material; - Images imprinted using heat dyesublimation technique for lasting effects; - Size: 4 sizes; - CARE: no extra care, machine washable andtumble dryer safe.  AVAILABLE SIZES: Twin: 1*Duvet cover: 69 by 86 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Full: 1*Duvet cover: 81 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Queen: 1*Duvet cover: 90 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches King: 1*Duvet cover: 104 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches FINISH: Step 1: Lay the comforter flat on top of your mattress. Step 2: Take your duvet cover and turn it inside out. Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. You should now be holding one corner in each hand. Step 3: With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners Step 4: Holding the top two corner slightly, flip the duvet cover right side out over the comforter. Give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. Step 5: Pull the duvet cover down. Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. Once everything is aligned, zip it up!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A138QpY9RjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARIGHTEX","source_asin":"B088FK4VZ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088FK4VZ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088FK4VZ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
