window.products.push({"id":456057,"name":"Americana Decor's Indian Mandala Tapestry Wall Hanging Throw Decorative New Mandala Throw (Pink Base)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oTl7QdgfL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is mandala tapestry since our mandala tapestries are handmade there may be minor imperfections ,.Our special feature of this Tapestry throw over that it's made out of high quality and won't fade away even after repeated usage and wash. A must have in any season for all ethnic savvy ones. This is a rare beauty not to be missed, a genuine collector's item & the result of masterly workmanship. * This Tapestries are completely screen printed in traditional Indian method and takes around a week to complete. The original color of items which you buy may differ minutely from the images due to camera capture sensitivity, lighting & even your system screens, so there may be a minor possibility in change of brightness & contrast. Depending on the size ◆ ◆ SIZE MATTERS -- You have room to snuggle up with your favorite beach partner! Our TAPESTRY fit up to 2 people comfortably! The extra large size measures five feet (84X98 inches) the perfect amount of space to share with your significant other, child, pet. ◆ ◆ SUPER SOFT BLANKET -- High quality COTTON made & printed in India. NOT STICKY SAND & NOT FADED, A wonderful example of Indian craftsmanship. ◆ ◆ BREATHER -- This TAPESTRY is very breathable and moisture wicking. It can speed up the spread of water,so it can dry quickly. ◆ ◆ MULTI-PURPOSE -- Not just a gorgeous beach towel or beach blanket ! Use it for park picnics, yoga, meditation, poolside lounging. You can even use as a campside blanket even just as a beautiful throw or bohemian tapestry for your indoor décor. ◆ ◆ WASHING INSTRUCTION -- Hand wash separately In cold water or hang dry,please do not bleach..If there any issue about this product,please feel free to contract us first,we will resolve this or refund for you \"Thank for Your Valuable Time\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oTl7QdgfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Americana Decor's","source_asin":"B01LXECBIJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXECBIJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXECBIJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
