window.products.push({"id":456259,"name":"Kingdom Decor Hello Sign for Front Door. 12” Hello Door Sign for Front Porch Decor, Front Door Decor, Rustic Door Decor, Housewarming Gifts New Home D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A63tKd0wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No crafts required! While every other wooden hello sign seems like a sparse work-in-progress, we created a 12” hello wooden sign that is 100% finished – spruced up with wreath and bow! Not to mention the metal door mount that lets you hang it as soon as it arrives – unique to Kingdom Decor Hang it immediately: Instead of fussing to create a hello wreath, you can hang your sign and enjoy it now. Simply hook the 12” Hanger over your door and hang your sign! Your set includes (1) sign with burlap and eye hooks (1) metal hanger (2) double-sided tape to stabilize your sign on windy days. Smooth finish: To create a smooth ‘blemish free’ look for your sign we purposely avoided wood that splinters, in favor of MDF. This creates a soft elegant finish and more consistency across the entire design. It’s also the reason our cursive letters and black accents are so welcoming to look at! Enjoy your new house! Welcome signs for front porch or door decorations are obvious house warming presents for new home, and if they’re a newly married couple, then of course they’re easy unisex house warming presents for couple. And this sign is 100% ready to hang without extra craft work! Lifetime warranty: Don’t worry about the wreath or bow falling off because we stapled it on firmly instead of using weak glue. But if something weird should happen to your front door sign, let us know because you’re covered by our Lifetime Warranty. Farmhouse Home Decor, by Kingdom Decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A63tKd0wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kingdom Decor","source_asin":"B08DDHBLNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DDHBLNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DDHBLNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
