window.products.push({"id":456315,"name":"Pilgrim Home and Hearth FGND 18467 Full Height Door Fireplace Screen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":140.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDdPhH0ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"An all-time favorite of the American hearth. This screen is designed to fit most fireplace openings. Durable, heavy duty solid iron construction compliment the screen's sleek hand forged handles that sit at the center of the large doors for easy access to the fire. Smooth bullet hinged doors allow for the door to completely open and quality block magnets will hold them securely closed. Sizes to fit medium and taller fireplace openings, the handsome screen is available in Vintage Iron, Matte Black or Burnished Bronze. Don' be fooled by cheap knock-off copies that are made from lightweight tube frame construction. All Pilgrim FGN and FGND Series fireplace screens use solid iron frames, precision welding with perfectly mitered corners for the highest fit and finish on the market. Don't settle for less when it comes to the center of your home. Trust Pilgrim. A Pilgrim Original DesignLifetime GuaranteePilgrim Home and Hearth, a US based leading designer, manufacturer and wholesale distributor of high quality Hearth & Home fireplace and home décor accessories for over 65 years.Pilgrim is trusted by millions of families to be at the center of the home with beautiful fireplace screens, fireplace tool sets and hundreds of unique home décor solutions. Pilgrim’s success is based on thoughtful design, honest materials, careful craftsmanship and lasting customer satisfaction.Pilgrim is a strategic OEM partner for some of the most influential and respected retail brands in the country. The fireplace accessories from Pilgrim’s collections are regularly featured on movie sets, design and architectural publications.Pilgrim manufactures a broad collection of fresh décor essentials designed for every style of home and fireplace all backed by Pilgrim’s legendary Lifetime Quality Guarantee.Remember, the consequence of poor quality lingers long after the thrill of a bargain is forgotten.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDdPhH0ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pilgrim","source_asin":"B00A2JJFG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A2JJFG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A2JJFG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
