window.products.push({"id":456329,"name":"Precious Moments Warm Wishes and Holiday Kisses Bisque Porcelain 181014 Figurine, One Size, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XpocL7-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Warm Wishes And Holiday Kisses bisque porcelain figurine continues Precious Moments’ time-honored tradition of sharing love with exquisite hand-painted porcelain figurines and ornaments. Wearing a Santa Claus cap with fluffy white trim perfectly matching the collar on her elegant pastel coat and comfy grey boots, a cute girl with rosy cheeks and closed eyes gives her handsome sweetheart a kiss on the cheek. The sweet young man is bundled for the Christmas season in a warm red sweater under a grey jacket and khakis, a perfect Christmas outfit. Sharing warm wishes and holiday kisses with a romantic Christmas gift wrapped in festive holiday plaid with a shiny golden gift bow, the happy couple stands atop a brick-looking base surrounded by snow. Add a lovely touch to a Christmas table centerpiece or a little romance and Christmas flair to a mantel with other unique Christmas decor. Display this hand-painted collectible Christmas decoration under the mistletoe near a Christmas tree adorned with holiday ornaments and twinkling Christmas lights . Measuring approximately 5. 5H x 4. 75W x 4D inches, the Warm Wishes And Holiday Kisses Christmas figurine is meticulously sculpted of bisque porcelain and expertly hand-painted. Give this romantic Christmas gift to the love of your life and share love, the best Christmas gift of all. For more than 40 years, Precious Moments has been devoted to making the world a kinder place by helping people share love. A timeless brand, Precious Moments helps you celebrate everyday moments and commemorate special occasions with hand-painted porcelain figurines and ornaments as well as contemporary kitchenware, home decor, baby gifts, and more. A unique inspirational message lies at the heart of every Precious Moments product, thoughtfully designed so you can turn your special moments into memories that last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XpocL7-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precious Moments","source_asin":"B07N4VW3F1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N4VW3F1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N4VW3F1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
