window.products.push({"id":456385,"name":"Homwel Wall Mount Hair Dryer Hanging Rack Organizer - Bathroom Storage Basket for Hair Dryer, Flat Iron, Curling Wand, Hair Straightener, Brushes - Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wvsHsKqAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Features: - Extreme beauty and elegance, combination of intelligence and perfection., profoundness and nobleness. -Odorless, tasteless and nontoxic. -Durable and not easy to get rusty, used high quality Aluminum as material, superb quality. -This storage shelf are easy to install, just simply screw the shelf into the wall and you will have a funny way to tidy your things. -Wall-mounted, convenient and practical. -Multinational functions, toothbrushes and toothpaste, shavers and combs can be put on 2 cups, the table board still can be put some skin care products, -The Spiral shelf of the hair dryer can be circumrotated in 360 degree. How to use: 1. Refer to the size of product, drills 3 holes on the appropriate position of wall surface. 2. Put the plastic nail into the hole. 3. Fix the strip with the screw. 4. Hang two cups on the panel of the shelf. 5. According to the same method to fix the helical mount. Specifications: Material: Aluminum Alloy Color: Silver Item weight: 0.77 lb (approx) Item size: 11.6 x 5.3 x 4.5 inches (approx) Package Contents: 1 x Hair Dryer Rack Set 2 x cups 1 x shelf 1 x some fittings with a bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wvsHsKqAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homwel","source_asin":"B08G85V1G7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G85V1G7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G85V1G7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":456386,"name":"Osti OT522PURPLE Original Cheese Slicer in Stainless Steel with Purple Handle, 9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gYi5f7CIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In love with cheese? Add a Danish Original to your kitchen and your cheese board: The Osti Original double-stringed cheese slicer was invented by Danish Osti in 1963. Coveted for its classic simplicity, the Original has since become a household icon for cheese aficionados throughout the world. With the Original, Osti invented the world’s first double-stringed cheese slicer, letting you cut both thick and thin slices (5/32”+5/64”) in one. Made from sturdy stainless steel with an ergonomic handle in food-safe polypropylene, the Osti Original comes in nine classic and vibrant colors to fit your home and your mood. Handle a broad variety of semi-hard and semi-soft cheese with ease, including Cheddar, Monterey Jack, Provolone, Swiss Cheese, Gouda, Muenster and many more – and give that extra dash of Danish Design to your cheese board. The built-in cheese fork elegantly lets you lift and place the freshly cut cheese slices. The Original goes directly in the dishwasher, and is suitable for both kids and grown-ups, letting the whole family enjoy cheese the way it’s meant to: At Osti we know that freshly sliced cheese just tastes better. Whether for cherishing your cheese board, prepping your picnic, going upscale on your get-together or simply enjoying cheese, you will not go wrong with the Osti Original – a proven Danish icon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gYi5f7CIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Osti","source_asin":"B07YR8MVNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YR8MVNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YR8MVNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
