window.products.push({"id":456399,"name":"SMUG LED Lights, 40 Inch Simple Style, Home Study Desk, Modern Computer Game Table, Office Writing Workstation, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717weiqrgaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cool LED Lighting: There are four decorative caps on the each edge of two black Z-shaped mainstays. You can light this purple-bluish cuties up to freshen up your gaming environment. Let this computer table become one of the indispensables pieces of ideal gaming equipment. Express your original taste with this special home desk for gamers. Perfect Size: Our gaming tables size is about 40x 20 inches. Desk Height is 30.6\" with plenty of legroom for rest. They are suitable for most occasions. Getting yourself this piece of furniture, you can use it as a gaming desk, computer desk, working table, and writing study desk in a study room, bedroom, living room, kitchen, children's room, and office. Durable & Stable Z Shaped Design: Using the powerful Z-shaped sheet metal, our gaming desk demonstrates superior durability and can withstand up to 132 lbs. Meanwhile, the bottom of the leg is secured pads and ensures the table is stable even on uneven ground, standing without wobbling. Let's start a hearty game! Easy to install & Clean: Our black gaming desks are extremely easy to assemble. All hardware is included in the package, and you can build it up within 10 minutes! A special latch structure for the bottom side of the table lets you put the gaming table together pretty fast. The desk is covered with high-pressure eco-friendly sturdy particleboard, which effectively prevents scratching, water damage and is easy to clean. Rest Assured to Purchase - Assembling this desk is fairly easy. (About 20 minutes). And the instructions are easy to follow. We have a professional customer service team. If you have any questions about the product, please do not hesitate to contact us. Is Assembly Required: True Item weight: 31 pounds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717weiqrgaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMUG","source_asin":"B0B28XLBDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B28XLBDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B28XLBDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":456400,"name":"Pointells Digital Cycle Clock with Non-Abbreviated Day of Week & Day Cycle – Ideal for The Elderly & Those Struggling with Memory Loss, Dementia, Etc.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713kb1QHdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A clock without numbers – or confusion. At Pointells we are always focused on easing the common burdens in life with simple, intuitive and affordable solutions, and this clock is a shining example. When caring for an aging loved one, our uniquely designed digital cycle clock presents a unique solution for a common problem: the confusion between AM and PM. As those struggling with early-onset Alzheimer’s, dementia, or ripe old age know, they are often unsure whether it’s day or night, which can negatively affect their medication schedule and personal comfort. Cleary Displays Day Cycle Rather than sufficing with AM/PM or with a little dot next to the digits, our clock displays one of 4 day cycles to inform the user of the current quadrant of the day: Morning, Afternoon, Evening and Night. The cycle start times are customizable. Made w/Memory Loss in Mind Advancing age, dementia, stroke, and Alzheimer's leave millions of Americans to struggle with memory loss and difficulty processing abbreviated words. To make life easier, our clock features non-abbreviated weekday and day cycle names. Bright Word Display – No Digits Extra-large, crystal-clear white letters shine bright and sharp against our clock’s deep-black display. This delivers unmatched contrast and clarity for visibility from across the room, while the lack of digits removes any agitation and confusion.. A/C Power Adapter Included An included AC adapter powers the clock on a daily basis. For extra convenience, an internal battery maintains the correct time when the clock is unplugged, ensuring you get the time and day cycle whenever you plug back in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713kb1QHdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pointells","source_asin":"B017X5LYH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017X5LYH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017X5LYH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
