window.products.push({"id":456583,"name":"Set of 16 Faux Assorted Velvet Pumpkins Decorative Teal Blue Green Gray Ivory Fabric Pumpkins Foam Pumpkins for Farmhouse Fall Wedding Thanksgiving Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M8mevVC7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Package includes 16 pcs Faux Assorted Velvet Pumpkins in 8 colors, they are rich to the colors and soft to the texture. These pumpkins create an instant arrangement collection for fall decoration, and also look fabulous mixed in with your existing autumn decor. Color: The set of fall decorative pumpkins features a non-traditional color palette of teal, turquoise, aqua, sage, slate blue, light blue, gray and ivory. Each pumpkin comes with a short brown stem. In a mix of neutral color, these pumpkins are flexible for all seasons, perfectly complement and add a pop of color to your modern rustic decor or farmhouse decor. Size: The small fabric pumpkins are available in 2 sizes, including 3.9\" wide and 3.2\" tall, 3.1\" wide and 2.6\" tall. In small size, they are easy to add to your home assortment as seasonal bowl fillers, table scatters, table centerpiece, tier tray decor, you can also add them to fall wreath, fall flower arrangements or simply display them on any tabletop to liven up a room. Material: Each artificial pumpkin is handmade out of soft velvet fabric, and the inside is stuffed with pumpkin shaped styrofoam balls to give it a lifelike shape and appearance. A brown resin pumpkin stem is topped for a more rustic authentic look. These velvet pumpkins are well made with fine detail, which are durable to be used year after year! Faux pumpkin is a perfect addition to rustic fall wedding centerpiece, wedding reception tablescapes, place settings, table scatters, place card settings, seasonal bowl display, Thanksgiving table settings, tier tray decor, Halloween party decor, photo props, fall wreaths, garland, fall floral arrangements, fall tabletop display and more. They make lovely wedding favors, gifts for guests, housewarming gifts, hostess gifts, bridal shower gifts and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M8mevVC7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B0945SDVT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0945SDVT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0945SDVT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
