window.products.push({"id":456599,"name":"Queen Waterbed Sem Wave Mattress with Zipper Cover, Heater & Liner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":479.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l0ZzBjzmL._AC_SL1174_.jpg","description":"If you were looking for a queen size semi wave-less waterbed mattress then this mattress kit may be the one for your. It includes a bamboo zipper cover which will increase comfort by adding a very soft & breathable surface between you and the semi wave water mattress. The zipper cover unzips like a suite case & the heater, liner & waterbed mattress goes inside the cover & after the semi wave water mattress is filled you zip it closed for a nice look & the cover will help protect your mattress and you also notice that your sheets will stay a lot better. The cover will also insulate the mattress so your heater will turn less. But most important the cover makes the already very comfortable semi wave water mattress even more comfortable. The very top part of the cover will unzip off for easy maintenance. The semi wave mattress has 1 layer of fiber which reduces the movement to about 10 seconds which is about half the movement of a free flow. But this is still considered a good amount motion. The 12 mil safety liner is the best quality available so you know if you ever have an issue with the mattress you have the proper protection. Also included is our most reliable waterbed heater that is manufacturer by Calesco who not only makes waterbed heaters they also make heating systems for many large industries. For example heating systems on car mirrors & seats. The kit includes 2 bottles of 8oz waterbed conditioner, 1 bottle of bubble remover which will help air release while filling and bottle vinyl cleaner. Also included is a waterbed fill kit which will make it easy hook your hose to most faucets and to the water mattress. If you like the better things in life and want semi wave waterbed mattress that is very comfortable and consumer friendly then this is the mattress for you. Our Mattress Covers Amazon Store always has the newest products for your waterbed. Keep in mind this is a mattress kit & the waterbed frame in not included. Email with ?.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l0ZzBjzmL._AC_SL1174_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U.S. Water, Glideaway, Aqua Fusion, Calesco","source_asin":"B00W5RVJQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W5RVJQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W5RVJQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
