window.products.push({"id":456639,"name":"Glasstery Travel Glass Juicing Bottle - Jar Cups - Leak-proof Reusable Glass Water Bottle for Drinking Kombucha Tea Smoothies Milk – Shatter-Resistant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hTfRoTwsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍶 TERRIFIC SET OF 8 REUSABLE GLASS WATER BOTTLES WITH CAPS – Whether at home, work, gym, hiking, or in between, a pretty glass drinking jar bottle is the coolest way to stay hydrated on the go. Its clear, straight-sided design, non-slip textured bottom & high-quality screw-on lid are fun AND simple to use! Enjoy fresh water, delicious homemade coffee, iced tea, vitamin-rich milk, anywhere, in style, worry-free. This pack of 8 x 18 oz glass bottles with lids is spill-proof AND divinely sturdy. ☕ EXCELLENT FOR BOTTLING YOUR FAVORITE BEVERAGES – Store, serve, carry and display your yummy liquid pick-me-ups in the cutest glass jar cups with lids. Toss them in your handbag, gym/work bag to have the purest flavors at hand, all day long. Ideal for iced tea, nutrient-packed infusions, cold coffee brews, mouth-watering milkshakes, or freshly-pressed juices. Convenient, a breeze to maintain, fill, and refill wherever your active lifestyle takes you, without worrying about messy dripping. Phew! 🏡 SPECTACULAR STORAGE OF DRINKS OR DRY GOODS – A timeless combination of tasteful aesthetics & impressive functionality! The airtight seal lid boosted by crystal-clear transparency makes these reusable drink containers an impressively versatile alternative for preserving spices, herbs, sweets, cereal, tea leaves, coffee beans, pasta, sugar, flour, candy, cookies, dog treats, nuts, rice and more. Glasstery glass food storage containers ooze effortless charm AND practical endurance! 🥛 CRACK-PROOF, SLEEK & ECO-FRIENDLY GLASS – A cut above stainless steel or plastic, we only use BPA-free, lead-free, natural glass to protect the ultimate purity of your preferred flavorful aromas. Achieve maximum shatter-resistant defense from bangs or drops for healthy, great-tasting drinks on the go, with 0% transfer of odor or taste between uses. The perfectly-wide mouth (secured with reinforced lid) is ultra-suitable for hassle-free opening, cleaning, popping in ice cubes, or fruity bits. 🏵️ NO-NONSENSE PREMIUM QUALITY OR YOUR MONEY BACK – Most glass storage containers with lids on the market crack easily and barely survive washing! Their poor quality doesn’t seal well, has wax or plastic-covered paper inner liner (predisposed to unpleasant build-ups). With Glasstery, you get modern, thicker, heavier top-class glass, freezer/microwave/dishwasher safe, topped with handy, food-grade PET lids. All tucked in 100% recyclable packaging, sustainably shipped to your home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hTfRoTwsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glasstery","source_asin":"B099PYNGYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099PYNGYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099PYNGYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
