window.products.push({"id":456668,"name":"12 x 3.4oz Strong Magnetic Spice Jars Glass Empty, Spice Jars with Rewritable Bottom(12 Bottles) Chalk Pen and Wall Mount Steel Board all included, to","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uU-4Smh-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Magnetic Spice Jars</b> – Spices are NOT included. Jars are made with heavy-duty glass. Magnet is hidden inside the lid for easy cleaning and would not make contact with the spices, yet it’s powerful enough to hold the spice jar in place. Magnetic Lids can be attached to most metal surfaces grants you easy access to your spices. Helps to make your spice easy to reach and organized, no more digging into the cabinet to find what you need. Rewritable Bottom Disc – each set of spice jars comes with a pen. You can write your favorite spice’s name on the black bottom disc of the jars, no more making labels. Or, be creative and turn it into a piece of art by handwriting your labels. Just like calligraphy! Saving Space with a set of Stylish Nesting Containers – the package includes: 12 (2 oz) hexagon-shaped bottles, 1 steel board, 1 pen, and 1 set of installation screws and plastic studs. The steel board can be wall-mounted and helps to save counter-top space in the kitchen effectively. With the hexagon containers nesting nicely together, it will become a highlight to your kitchen. Spice jars can also be used separately on most of the metal surfaces, for example, the surface of some refrigerators. Platform Steel Board – Our 0.5-inch platform steel board gives a high-quality finish. The material is sturdy, durable, resistant to chipping, fading, and wearing which helps to protect the surfaces from corrosion and other environmental damages. It is a safe and healthy choice for home and kitchen use. You can also turn this stunning board into a message board, keep your recipe handy while cooking or attach a shopping list on it, so you won’t forget what to get from grocery shopping next time. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee – If there are any issues, please feel free to contact us and we will assist you. Refund is handled by Amazon, please contact customer service if needed. Cleaning – not dishwasher safe! Wash thoroughly before use. Recommended hand wash and air dry before using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uU-4Smh-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LJ BRIGHTEN UP LIFE LIVING JOY","source_asin":"B0989N32WK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989N32WK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989N32WK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":456669,"name":"Boning knife kitchen knife deboning knives Damascus japanese VG10 steel kitchen knife boning knives for fish knives G10 Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kLVlx-HwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What is VG-10 steel? VG10 steel is produced in Japan, and the Japanese tableware market has traditionally made full use of this special type of steel in knives.Due to the ability of VG10 to maintain the edges and its ability to prevent rust, VG10 has become the favorite steel for professional chefs and cooking enthusiasts. VG10 also has an amazing ability to create designs into the blade during the temperament period. VG10 kitchen knife compared to low-end metal, it will be expensive, but it is worth it. Yi Chef is a brand that knows knives-carefully made Three generations of Yi Chef brand ingenuity make knives. The knives we forged are extremely sharp and durable. The ancient craftsmanship and modern machinery and equipment make us more comfortable in making knives. Features: ✓ Sharp as a blade, Japanese cutting edge technology single cutting edge 14-16° angle, easier and faster in food cutting, keeping the natural taste of food. ✓The hardness of 60-62 cutter can make the cutter more durable. ✓ The 67 layers of Damascus are sharpened by the ancient three-step Benbazuk method and combined with cutting-edge technology. ✓ The tapered pillow provides perfect balance, finger protection, and gently encourages a natural and comfortable pinch feeling. ✓ Corrosion-resistant/corrosion-resistant cladding means your knife will stay clean and have a longer service life. ✓ The triple riveted G10 handle is comfortable, hygienic and break-proof. ✓ The tapered blade can minimize the cutting resistance and non-stick performance. ✓ Easy to clean. DESCRIPTION: Damascus Boning Knife Brand : YI Knife Overall Length: : 26cm/10.2in Blade Length: :14.5cm/5.5in Blade Material : Japanese VG10 Steel Handle Material : G10 Handle with Engraved Rivet & Mosaic Pin Rockwell Hardness : 58 Net Weight : 0.12KG/0.26lb Application : boning knives","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kLVlx-HwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brandless","source_asin":"B08CF26HTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CF26HTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CF26HTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
