window.products.push({"id":456679,"name":"2 Pack Ice Cube Trays, 14 Ice Cube Trays for Freezer with Lid, Easy-Release & Durable, Silicone Ice Cube Tray, Mini Ice Cube Trays, BPA Free, Odorless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BfDZwAemL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We were once fanatics of ice cube trays just like you. After using thousands of different ice cube trays, we determined to make a perfect ice cube tray and recommended it to you: Professional Quality This silicone ice cube tray made from food-safe grade materials. It is BPA free, odorless and safe. Mini and Stackable Design The mini ice cube tray adopts a circular design, which makes more reasonable use of its internal space. You can hold it completely with one hand. These mini ice cube trays can be simply stacked together to minimize the space occupied by the refrigerator. Easy to Release The silicone material can easily remove ice cubes. The lid prevents ice cubes from absorbing odors in the refrigerator, make ice cubes fresher. How to Use 1. Pour the water into this ice cube tray and freeze for several hours. 2. Take it out after 6-10 hours. 3. Take the lid off the ice cube trays, the ice cubes can be easily released by just pressing the silicone at the bottom of the tray. 4. Enjoy the fresh ice cubes you make.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BfDZwAemL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZTML MS","source_asin":"B09JNSNF98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JNSNF98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JNSNF98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
