window.products.push({"id":456694,"name":"8x10 Shadow Box Frame for Pictures, Photos, Pins, Medals, Tickets, Black Wood Frame - Wall Tabletop Display Case, 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LTA37rpRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shadow Box is great for holding ticket stubs, travel tickets, wedding cards, sea shells, etc. It can also used for guests to write advice to the new bride and groom. Shadow Box Specs: -Linen display backboard, Back loading. -Hanging hardware is pre-attached.(2 seamless nails and 10 or more colorful push pins) Display a cherished memory with FRAME YI shadow box frame. It's designed to hold objects or photographs. Use it to display small trinkets or a painting on a thick canvas. Create your own small collections of items for a uniquely personal touch. This display shadow box frame comes with a clear plexiglass insert to protect whatever you choose to keep in it.(That can easily be removed for an open shadowbox). The wide, neutral border and simple design go well with a variety of decors and color schemes. Its clean lines suit the atmosphere of almost any home or office space, while the classic style makes this box frame comes ready to hang for your convenience. Can stand on a table or counter, or can be wall mounted with included hangers. Backing can also be easily opened to arrange or remove items. Under linen display area is corkboard for easy stick pin attachment of ribbons, photos, small items.... If you prefer, you can easily cover linen with your own fabric or paper. Frame is constructed with quality in mind, and is easy to open and arrange items inside. It's time to show off your work! Showcase your favorite scrapbook pages, photos or artwork with the deep shadow box frame. With its sleek, simple design, this wooden box frame is a striking way to add a creative, personal touch to your home's decor. This box frame holds 3D objects masterieces. Shadowboxes are great to display photos, postcards and souvenirs from your favoriate vacations. Got a graduate? This shadow box will be a lovely way to showcase school pictures, graduation program, commencement tassels and other mementos.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LTA37rpRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRAME YI","source_asin":"B07ZH5QC7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZH5QC7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZH5QC7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
