window.products.push({"id":456776,"name":"HOMFINE Cervical Memory Foam Pillow - Ergonomic Contour Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief, Orthopedic Pillow for Neck Support, Butterfly Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pk3mzSLyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAND NEW AND TRULY ERGONOMIC DESIGN: The new ergonomically designed cervical contour memory foam pillow integrates 6 contour support areas scientifically. Providing soft comfy and firm support for neck, head, shoulders and arms precisely and perfectly. Reducing stress of cervical vertebra and spine during sleep. Improving sleep and relieving neck and shoulder pain. GREATLY IMPROVE SLEEP QUALITY: Proven contour memory foam support area, height, size and high density 3s slow rebound memory foam can provide soft and strong support according to your body curve, keeping the cervical vertebra, spine and breathing channels in the best state when back and side sleeping. Improving cervical strain, insomnia, headache, snoring. Greatly improving the quality of sleep, making you refreshed and energetic every day. PERFECT FOR DIFFERENT SLEEPERS: In addition to the protection of the cervical vetebra and spine when back sleeping, specially developed 3s slow rebound memory foam with 5.1\" side sleeping support is thick, soft and comfy. Ensuring no pressure on the shoulders to get full body relaxation. Arm-wrapped area provides natural placements for your arms and a firm cuddle touch to avoid arm numbness and body stiffness when stomach sleeping. PREMIUM CERVICAL PILLOW: Integrated with softness, comfort and strong support, HOMFINE 100% high-density 3S slow rebound memory foam is premium durable and can always provides you with comfy support. CertiPUR-US certified memory foam and OEKO-TEST 100 certified removable and washable microfiber pillowcase are 100% healthy and safe. Allowing you to easily enjoy the pleasure and relaxation of sleep all the time. BREATHABLE AND COOL: The double-layer breathable cloth cover can well protect the memory foam, while ensuring air circulation on the surface, keeping the pillow cool and comfortable at all times. The removable washable outer cover is easy to clean. NOTICE: When firstly unpack and take the pillow out, this memory foam pillow may take 1-2 days to regain its shape and elasticity. This is normal, please don't worry. Besides, THIS PRODUCT IS NOT A MEDICAL PRODUCT. Can only be used for daily sleep improvement. SATISFACTORY WARRANTY: HOMFINE provides 30-day worry-free refund guarantee and 1 year warranty. This pillow is specially designed for most people. If you feel that the pillow height and hardness are not appropriate or have any other questions when receiving the product, please do not hesitate to contact us, we will provide you with satisfactory after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pk3mzSLyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMFINE","source_asin":"B0BHP814PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHP814PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHP814PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
