window.products.push({"id":456801,"name":"DI ORO Silicone Tongs for Cooking - Heat-Resistant Kitchen Tongs for Cooking with Silicone Tips - Small 9\" & Large 12\" Tongs for Nonstick Cookware - S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fonAiTiLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEAVY-DUTY STAINLESS-STEEL KITCHEN TONGS - While cheap and inferior tongs consistently fail, the DI ORO 2-Piece Silicone Kitchen Tong Set is engineered with heavy-duty stainless steel and silicone tips to prevent scratches and damage to your cookware. Each set will stand the test of time as they have been rigorously kitchen tested and expertly sized (9” and 12”) to ensure a multitude of applications can be used on a daily basis in home and commercial kitchens. EFFORTLESS & HASSLE-FREE USE – The simple to use and dependable locking mechanism will not damage like your old clumsy tongs taking up space in your kitchen drawers. Our innovative comfort grip allows for complete control and limited effort to serve meats and other heavy foods. You can have 100% confidence knowing that dropping food on your floor is an inconvenience of the past. THE LAST KITCHEN TONGS YOU WILL EVER NEED – It’s time to throw away your old and rusty metal kitchen tongs. Our tongs are built to last, rust and corrosion resistant, and ready to handle years of kitchen use. Our BPA free and food grade silicone tips are heat resistant up to 480°F, and are the perfect length to keep your hands from the heat and out of the food you create. CLEAN-UP MADE EASY –The DI ORO tongs are simple to clean by hand and are dishwasher safe, so you will have less time cleaning and more time to spend with your family. The removable silicone tips prevent the build-up of food and grime you experience with cheaper off the shelf brands. It’s time to treat yourself to the everyday utility your old tongs could never provide. WHAT SETS US APART – Unlike other brands aiming to just sell a product to their customers, at DI ORO we aim to provide years of lasting memories and positive experiences. Our customers mean everything to us, so we have set the bar with our Forever Warranty and second to none customer service. We will replace any damaged or defective product for free or provide a full refund if you are not satisfied with your purchase; forever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fonAiTiLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"di Oro Living","source_asin":"B09S1DFXNB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S1DFXNB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S1DFXNB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
