window.products.push({"id":456809,"name":"Chicago Metallic Non-Stick Checkerboard Cake Pan Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CP3G1E4GL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description An American classic, the checkerboard cake mystifies and amazes. This Checkerboard Cake Set comes with three 9 x 1 inch non-stick cake pans, a plastic batter divider and instructions. Don't worry though, this impressive cake is easy to make. Simply place the batter divider in pan A; alternate the batters from outside in; and remove the ring. Now, place the batter separator in pan B, only this time reverse the order of te batter. For pan C, use the same order as pan A. Bake the cakes, stack in order, frost and you've got a cake that's sure to impressive both young and old. For clean-up, the pans are non-stick for easy release and dishwasher safe as well. Amazon.com If you enjoy wowing your friends and family with amazing cakes, you should seriously consider adding this Chicago Metallic checkerboard pan set to your cookware collection. Crafted from high-quality, noncorrosive metal and featuring a two-ply nonstick coating, the set contains three 9-inch round cake pans and a plastic batter divider. Just place the divider in a pan, pour two alternating batters (one dark and one light) into the three circles the divider creates, then remove the divider and bake. Stack the finished layers so the colors alternate. When your cake is cut, a luscious, three-layered checkerboard masterpiece will be revealed. The nonstick finish makes cleanup easy, and the pans are dishwasher-safe as well. If you choose to wash them by hand, though, use a nylon pad--rather than steel wool or abrasive cleaners--to protect the nonstick surface. This set comes with instructions and a recipe for chocolate-and-vanilla cake. --Marianne Painter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CP3G1E4GL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chicago Metallic","source_asin":"B00004R90W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004R90W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004R90W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":456810,"name":"Collections Etc Elegant Embroidered Fall Leaves Mantel Scarf with Delicate Cutouts and Scalloped Edges","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPlzsd8DL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Elegant Embroidered Fall Leaves Mantel Scarf with Delicate Cutouts and Scalloped EdgesDescriptionDress your fireplace for the season with this lovely mantel scarf that features beautifully embroidered leaves, berries and vines. The beautiful yellows, reds and browns look great against the cream background. Intricate cutouts and scalloped edges add a touch of elegance and style. Machine wash. Polyester; imported. 69 1/2\"L x 17 1/2\"W.Material TypePolyester.Shop with confidence! For over 50 years, Collections Etc has been bringing unique, whimsical, inspirational, and home solution products to customers. All Collections Etc products come with a 60 day, easy return policy and 100% satisfaction guarantee.About Collections Etc’s Table LinensTable linens are a quick, easy, and inexpensive way to update your dining room table. Our selection of table linens includes a variety of designs so you can change your table as often as you’d like. From traditional to decorative table linens, let us help you set the perfect meal with great finishing touches of fabric.No Risk Purchase, Hassle-Free Returns - 100% Satisfaction GuaranteedWith customer satisfaction as our number one priority, we proudly offer a Satisfaction Guarantee for all our merchandise and services. From our appealing merchandise and incredible values, to our friendly customer service, we strive to provide a positive shopping experience by meeting or exceding your expectations. If you are not completely satisfied within 60 days of your purchase (see return policy for details).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPlzsd8DL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Collections Etc","source_asin":"B07V3ZWSTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V3ZWSTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V3ZWSTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":456811,"name":"ZNSAYOTX 2 Piece Jacquard Chair Slipcover for Living Room Super Stretch Chair Covers with Arms Pet Dog Universal Slip Cover Anti Slip Armchair Furnitu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gA7EmQWOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 SEPARATED DESIGN - ZNSAYOTX 2 piece armchair slipcovers are specially designed for 1 cushion chair couch, the package includes one base chair cover, one cushion cover. Highly recommended for sofa with separated cushion. Due to the separating designs, the magic sofa slipcover can decor your sofa without changing the sofa. Elastic bands sewn on the bottom of both cushion cover and base slipcover, which can make the couch covers more suitable and anti slip High Stretch - ZNSAYOTX high elastic jacquard couch covers are crafted by 85% polyester and 15% spandex material. The premium fabric makes the stretch sofa covers soft, comfortable, skin friendly, wrinkle-free and durable. The heavy duty couch slipcovers with jacquard checkers fit for most types sofa: t-cushion sofas, box-cushion sofas, leather sofas, fabric sofa and extra large sofas, etc. And the miracle couch protector slipcovers are not easily pilling and fading, can be used for years 360-degree Full Protection - The fitted couch cover provide an universal coverage for your sofa furniture, even the back part and the bottom part of you sofa. The decorative sofa furniture protector can protect your sofa from daily stains, pet footprint, dog hair, cats scratch and some accidental tears. Besides, our couch slipcover can transform your old couch to a new delicate centerpiece. A effortless way to protect and decor your sofa while keeping the appearance Effortless Installation & Care - Installation is an easy case. Following the SOFA SLIPCOVER INSTALLASTION GUIDANCE, you can complete installment by one person within 10 minutes. The universal couch slipcovers are available for wash, also can machine wash. Separately wash at cold water and gentle cycle with mild detergent for good care and maintenance, tumble dry low or line dry. Besides, bleach and iron are not suitable for this stretchy couch slipcover Size Choose and Tips - 2 Piece Chair Cover: 31\"-46\", 3 Piece Loveseat Slipcover: 55\"-69\", 4 Piece Sofa Cover: 71\"-91\", 4 Piece XL Couch Cover: 91\"-110\". Please measure your sofa size before purchasing according to the MEASURING GUIDE. If your sofa size between two sizes, please choose the larger one. We firmly believe our stretchable elastic sofa cover will perfectly fit your sofa, but if you have any concerns or questions, we will be pleased to support you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gA7EmQWOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZNSAYOTX","source_asin":"B08F2F4TBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F2F4TBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F2F4TBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
