window.products.push({"id":456835,"name":"Mr. Beer 2 Gallon Hard Cider Homebrewing Craft Cider Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41A7umaPCyL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Mr. Beer Hard Cider Kit is completely reusable, giving you the freedom to brew batch after batch of flavorful hard cider in your own home. With the Mr. Beer Hard Cider Kit you will get the Hard Apple Cider Refill, the Mr. Beer two gallon cider fermenter, (8) 1 liter bottles with caps, along with Mr. Beer Hard Cider Brewing Instructions. All of the brewing equipment in your Mr. Beer Hard Cider kit is made from FDA compliant plastics, and will leave no flavor migration in your cider. Since the contents of the kit are made from PET plastic you do not have to worry about any broken fermenters or bottles. Mr. Beer has gone through all of the time consuming, and pain staking process to make your brewing experience as easy, and as fun as possible. The only thing you need to get brewing is water. Since the Mr. Beer Hard Cider Kit is completely reusable all you need is another Mr. Beer Cider Refill to get your next batch started, and before you know it you will be calling yourself a brew-master, and be making cider like the pros.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41A7umaPCyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Beer","source_asin":"B0013LZ2VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0013LZ2VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0013LZ2VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":456836,"name":"WEEKSUN Programmable Coffee Maker,12 Cups Drip Coffee Machine with Glass Carafe and Reusable Filter, Touch-Screen, Brew Strength Control, Self-Cleanin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61unkE0pGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"24-HOUR PROGRAMMABLE DELAY BREW - You can wake up everyday to the smell of freshly brewed coffee and a any other time of the day you like. The digital clock with a fully automatic 24-hour programmable timer on this coffee machine is easy to set up and allows you to prepare your brew in advance. CUSTOMIZABLE BREWING OPTIONS - Hot plate with 3 temperature settings keep freshly brewed coffee at around 167°F, 172°F or 178°F for 4hrs; 1-4 cup function allows you to choose between regular and bold coffee to suit your taste. ANTI-DRIP AND SELF-CLEANING FUNCTION - The anti drip function allows the coffee to stop brewing after the coffee pot has been removed. No more dripping or mess on your countertops. Cleaning the filter coffee machine is also so easy. You don't have to worry about boring wait staff. At the push of a button, the machine thoroughly cleans the interior itself. PERMANENT COFFEE FILTER AND EASY-VIEW WATER WINDOW - The water reservoir is easy to fill and equips with a water window which offers visibility as the tank is filled. The built-in coffee filtration saves money as there is no need for paper filters. Best of all, the accessories including the coffee filter basket, filter holder, and coffee pot are dishwasher safe. THE BEST TASTING COFFEE - Brew a full pot of coffee using your favorite grounds and with brew strength control you can select regular or bold coffee flavor, whatever you like better.The 12 Cups capacity of this coffee machine allows you to share delicious hot coffee with your family and friends any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61unkE0pGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEEKSUN","source_asin":"B08CK6YV36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CK6YV36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CK6YV36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
