window.products.push({"id":456917,"name":"INSE Corded Vacuum Cleaner, Corded Stick Vacuum with 600W Powerful Motor 18000Pa Handheld Vacuum Cleaner for Pet Hair Hard Floor Home - Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1p7hCP5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【600W Strong Motor】INSE I5 vacuum cleaner is equipped with a motor rated at 600W; it’s more powerful than most vacuums of its size - with the main body weighs only 3.3lbs. It can generate up to 18000Pa powerful suction, perfectly clean and vacuum wood floors, marble, tile, low pile carpet and easily pick up dust, pet hair, cereal, etc. 【Multi-functional】The corded vacuum cleaner is easy to assemble out of the box. It has 3 different accessory heads - main floor brush & crevice tool & 2-in-1 brush. There is a button on the main floor brush, you can switch it when cleaning different types of surfaces such as hard floors or short carpets. When converting from a stick vacuum cleaner to a handheld vacuum cleaner, it's very handy to get into small areas, stairs, and shelves. 【High-efficiency Filtration】The filtration system of this corded stick vacuum cleaner consists of a filter pad, cyclone filtration, and strainer. The fully sealed filtration system is capable of capturing all kinds of debris - not only ensure vacuum cleaners work properly but also keeps a clean and healthy home for your family. The filter is washable and reusable, please leave it dry before using it. The key to maximum performance is having clean filters. 【Perfect Length】INSE vacuum cleaner comes with a perfect long power cord, no need to worry about running out of power while allowing a 23ft long-path task. The 19-31 inches adjustable tube makes stick vacuum cleaner hardwood floor suitable for all family members. The portable vacuum cleaner also comes with a cord wrap and a hook for storing accessories. 【Easy to Use】This lightweight vacuum cleaner is easy to operate, one easy click can start vacuum, no need to keep pressing the switch. One simple press can empty the 1L dust cup without making your hand dirty. The filters are washable and reusable; a clean filter helps to maintain a decent suction and efficiency of this powerful vacuum cleaner. 【Convenient Storage】The vacuum cleaner corded comes with tiny storage tools, making organizing a piece of cake. You can collect the long cord with the cord wrap. There is a hook that can be attached to the tube to store accessories, very space-saving and convenient. This vacuum enjoys a 12-month warranty and prompt after-sale service provided by INSE Support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1p7hCP5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0BGLNRHQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGLNRHQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGLNRHQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
