window.products.push({"id":456964,"name":"Sandow Ltd Edition Replica - 1896 Pomeroy, NOT Mr Olympia Trophy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NuF-deuUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Frederick Pomeroy sculpted this in circa 1896. This piece is casted from the very original Sandow Statue Trophy - the very first bodybuilding trophy to have been created. The original piece (in photos) belonged to the Great Sigmund Klein. It was purchased when he passed in 1987. It then travelled from New York to Melbourne Australia. This is NOT the same as the Mr Olympia Trophy, which is a modified contemporary version produced by Joe Weider in 1977. This replica is a genuinely rare item, copied from the 1896 F. Pomeroy's Creation. The anatomical aesthetics of this Pomeroy's creation is obviously superior. And one can tell that it is the original hundred+ year old design merely by the relative shorter length of the barbell, compared to the contemporary attempt to modify (not replicate) this old time sculpture. This replica material is a combination of steel and resin, with gold paint individually skilfully applied by the trained hands of professional artists. The craftsmanship is of very high level. I personally guarantee that it will please the most discerning collector. What you WILL receive is replicated from a rare original 1902 original bronze Sandow photographed and shown in this ad. I have looked after and enjoyed this bronze Sandow since 2008 and simply want to share the joy! A word from the seller I want to assure you of my integrity as a person. These are my gyms that I own and operate (since 2002): Fitnessland Gym and Victors Gym (Melbourne Australia). You will also see me working with very strong and not-so-strong people/clients, and also my own workouts in video clips. I am showing you these so you may know that I am NOT a money-making fat bellied merchant. I care for this stuff! From me, you WILL get what you pay for (& MORE!). I hope to share the love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NuF-deuUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SalientDesigns","source_asin":"B078SJYVJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-456964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SJYVJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SJYVJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
